<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4391f47d4e14> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In the video, a Volvo XC90 SUV decked out in the sensors Uber uses to see the world plowed through the intersection roughly three seconds after the light went red, and as a pedestrian was stepping into the crosswalk." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "988" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6a3b90e6fe47> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "An Uber equipped to drive itself ran a red light in San Francisco’s SOMA neighborhood Wednesday morning, per a YouTube video apparently shot from a local Luxor cab and reported by The Examiner." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "988" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6c831dafc569> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "An autonomous Uber malfunctioned while in “self-driving mode” and caused a near collision in San Francisco." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "990" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c028f23b8951> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Even if it was a human at the wheel, it’s bad news on the day Uber announced it’s welcoming passengers aboard its fleet of driverless cars in the city, and that it’s doing so without filing for an autonomous testing permit with the California DMV." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "988" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/705f7628560d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The self-driving car – which Uber introduced without permits, as part of a testing program that California has deemed illegal – accelerated into an intersection while the light was still red and while the automation technology was clearly controlling the car, said Christopher Koff, owner of local cafe AK Subs.",
        "The self-driving car – which Uber introduced without permits, as part of a testing program that California has deemed illegal – accelerated into an intersection while the light was still red and while the automation technology was clearly controlling the car.",
        "The self-driving car – which Uber introduced without permits, as part of a testing program that California has deemed illegal – accelerated into an intersection while the light was still red." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "990" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b6b0afd12d8d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "After video of 1 of the violations surfaced in December, the company not only blamed and suspended the human monitoring the system, but doubled down." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "987" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b9a7d1dfecf2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Here’s the video of the erring Uber captured by Charles Rotter, operations manager at traditional cab company Luxor." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "989" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e0dac48238b7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Koff’s story, which advocacy group Consumer Watchdog shared with state officials on Tuesday, directly contradicts Uber’s public claims..." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "990" .

